<attribute name="problem" nodeId="7902b52">&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;July 2019 -&lt;/strong&gt; updated to align support managed services, including the following name/content changes
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Capability:&amp;nbsp;Configuration Management and Change Control =&amp;gt; Configuration Management
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Manage configuration items =&amp;gt; Modify configuration items
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Monitor and communicate on configuration management status =&amp;gt; Provide configuration status reports
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Added the following elements:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Review request
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Create configuration items
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Retire configuration items
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Establish a baseline
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Close request
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Task: Conduct configuration audit
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Outcome: Configuration Baseline Established
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
